  "prompt": "There is a 2024_StarMCN_H2_Strategy.pptx in the desktop competitor_analysis folder. This PPT has 50 pages and the content is very messy. Help me distill the core data and generate an executive summary, output to desktop competitor_analysis/StarMCN_Execution_Summary.docx.\n\nFocus on two parts: first, the base salary standards, revenue share ratios, and breach penalty clauses for newly signed streamers; second, the estimated operating costs of virtual streamers, including upfront procurement and monthly computing power and operating expenses. Other content such as empowerment, matrix playbook, industry macro, and team building is not needed.\n\nThe document must be controlled to within one page with a compact layout.",
